00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:43.330
<b>Choujuu-giga</b>

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:43.410
<b>Choujuu-giga</b>

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.260
<b>Apa Apa, everyone says they're busy,</b>

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.890
<b>and won't play Othello with me.</b>

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.300
<b>Well I'm busy too, you know?</b>

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.940
<b>Old man, let's play Othello!</b>

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.250
<b>What is it, Apachai-kun?</b>

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.350
<b>What did you just hide behind your back?</b>

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.970
<b>Is it really alright if I don't help?</b>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.850
<b>It's okay, it's okay!</b>

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:11.060
<b>Just forget the chores, take a good rest and read a nice book, okay?</b>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.030
<b>I'll take you up on your offer then.</b>

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.100
<b>Elder</b>

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.000
<b>Hey, Apachai-kun.</b>

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.540
<b>Play somewhere else.</b>

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.530
<b>Apachai-kun...?</b>

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.160
<b>Oh yes!</b>

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.260
<b>Apachai-kun, care for some <i>amanattō?</i></b>

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.260
<b>TL Note: Candied beans.</b>

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.990
<b>Yay, I'll eat them!</b>

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.640
<b>I didn't see anything!</b>

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.360
<b>So what is this...</b>

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:32.840
Choujuu-giga

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:32.880
Choujuu-giga

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:32.920
Choujuu-giga

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:32.960
Choujuu-giga

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.000
Choujuu-giga

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:44.140
Choujuu-giga

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.710
<b>This 100,000-yen Chōjū-giga?</b>

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.530
<b>Well, I recently got a bit of money.</b>

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:44.060
<b>It's my hobby to collect replicas of those scrolls.</b>

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:48.560
<b>Oh really... so you <i>did</i>  buy this extravagant thing after all.</b>

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:52.250
<b>Even though Miu-san keeps a record of every single yen spent here in an account book.</b>

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:56.200
<b>It's a meager form of entertainment for the wizened elderly.</b>

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.850
<b>This is something that must be reported to Miu-san without delay.</b>

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.970
<b>Just wait right there, Kenichi-kun.</b>

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:02.300
<b>Listen well,</b>

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.680
<b>entertainment is a vital part of one's being, regardless of our way of life.</b>

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.370
<b>All work and no play makes one dull.</b>

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.470
<b>No matter what kind of life one lives, there is pleasure in every nook and corner of their existence.</b>

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:14.270
<b>People need to spread their wings sometimes.</b>

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:15.460
<b>Do you understand?</b>

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.590
<b>Is that all you have to say?</b>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.140
<b>Please overlook it just this once!</b>

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:26.130
<b>Are you going to take away the one single enjoyment this old man lives for?</b>

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.210
<b>You demon!</b>

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.690
<b>Even if you say that,</b>

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:32.220
<b>I am totally drowned in Miu-san's kindness, hence I can't help but be on her side.</b>

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.460
<b>O-Oh yes, Ken-chan.</b>

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:40.000
<b>Aren't you the least bit curious on how Apachai-kun came to become a part of Ryōzanpaku?</b>

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.620
<b>Are you implying that this Chōjū-giga has something to do with that?</b>

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.330
<b>It is.</b>

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.520
<b>It is very related.</b>

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.330
<b>Well Kenichi-kun?</b>

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:52.570
<b>It's not too late to hear my story.</b>

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.120
<b><i>Actually, I'm  </i>really<i> interested.</i></b>

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.090
<b><i>That height that easily exceeds 6 feet, the giant well known in Underworld Muay Thai as the God of Death.</i></b>

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.760
<b><i>I am actually dying to know why he's here, simply eating  </i>amanattō<i> in a corner.</i></b>

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.380
<b>Let's hear it then.</b>

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.510
<b>If there's a good reason for your collection of these scrolls,</b>

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.750
<b>then I'd be more than happy to forget all about it.</b>

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.350
<b>You sure have a big heart.</b>

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.120
<b>That's Ryōzanpaku's number one disciple for you.</b>

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.730
<b>Yes, that was a long, long time ago,</b>

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:23.240
<b>a time when I was still traveling with young Miu.</b>

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:29.800
<b>This happened in a poor village in the southern part of a certain country.</b>

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:30.930
<b>Grandpa.</b>

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.340
<b>What is it Miu?</b>

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.930
<b>Our food reserves are about to run out.</b>

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.410
<b>Do we still have enough to last until our next destination?</b>

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.340
<b>Yes.</b>

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.250
<b>But no matter how far it may be,</b>

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.140
<b>if there are people in need,</b>

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:44.810
<b>we must still keep treading forward towards them.</b>

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.910
<b>Real work comes before the reward, Miu.</b>

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.920
<b>Yes, Grandpa!</b>

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:55.030
<b>Are the people from the village we heard about in the last town really in dire straits?</b>

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.870
<b>They are in dire need of us strong ones,</b>

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:02.520
<b>which is why they even made that desperate effort to deliver that letter across town.</b>

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:06.140
<b>This place is pretty worn down.</b>

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:09.440
<b>Hey! "They don't look prosperous" is more polite.</b>

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.020
<b>What you said earlier was rude.</b>

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:14.950
<b>Hello there, I'd like to meet with the elder of this town.</b>

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.680
<b><i>Something is off about this village.</i></b>

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.500
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.790
<b>Grandpa.</b>

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.550
<b>So you've noticed, eh?</b>

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.190
<b>It seems there's not a single child in this village.</b>

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.220
<b>But I suggest that shouldn't be so.</b>

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.160
<b>It'd just be a waste of energy.</b>

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.570
<b>That was splendid.</b>

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.070
<b>I humbly apologize.</b>

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:50.240
<b>We absolutely needed to test your strength.</b>

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.770
<b>You may be the one to hold the fate of the entire village,</b>

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:56.270
<b>so we had no choice but to see how strong you really were.</b>

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.170
<b>But now we are certain.</b>

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.430
<b>You are the legendary martial artist.</b>

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:02.260
<b>The one who devoured the demon.</b>

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.210
<b>Fūrinji Hayato!</b>

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.410
<b>This is the money we collected from the entire village.</b>

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:14.500
<b>This all that we were able to raise in the short time we had.</b>

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.230
<b>We'd like to pay you with this money in exchange for killing someone.</b>

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.780
<b>Ending a life may be a bit too much.</b>

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.010
<b>So you say that this person is really that evil?</b>

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:29.010
<b>He is in the business of smuggling drugs and arms, and has a stronghold at a nearby port.</b>

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.090
<b>He and his men constantly plunder and loot this village.</b>

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.350
<b>Is that all?</b>

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.790
<b>It is far more serious than that, is it not?</b>

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.100
<b>So you did realize it...</b>

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.760
<b>Our children...</b>

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.670
<b>Our future...</b>

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.470
<b>They've kidnapped all of our children,</b>

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.740
<b>and they plan on selling every single one of them.</b>

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:56.900
<b>If no children are left in this small village, our future is as good as doomed.</b>

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.670
<b>Grandpa, we can't just let those people be!</b>

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:00.710
<b>Let's do it!</b>

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:04.150
<b>I'm sorry, but I cannot accept this money.</b>

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:09.980
<b>Not until all of the children are returned unharmed.</b>

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.120
<b>So you'll do it?</b>

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:15.110
<b>That's right,</b>

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.730
<b>I shall keep your future preserved.</b>

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:20.400
<b>I shall eliminate every evildoer in that port, along with their leader.</b>

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.190
<b>I want you to be wary of one thing though.</b>

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:26.340
<b>The mercenary that they hired has monstrous strength that is beyond human comprehension.</b>

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.810
<b>Mercenary?</b>

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.760
<b>He is known as the God of Death in Underground Muay Thai.</b>

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.570
<b>His name is Apachai Hopachai.</b>

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.450
<b>Muay Thai you say?</b>

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:44.180
<b>Okay, let's observe the enemy first.</b>

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:47.580
<b>It looks like a western pirate's lair.</b>

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.970
<b>The area seems to be advantageous for them.</b>

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:54.860
<b>Miu, I'll go and take a look around.</b>

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.600
<b>Just stay here.</b>

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.470
<b>Okay, Grandpa.</b>

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.050
<b>One cannot battle when hungry.</b>

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.710
<b>Let's have lunch here.</b>

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:12.610
<b>This has got to be my lunch, whenever, wherever.</b>

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.380
<b>I'm digging in–</b>

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:35.210
<b>You can have one if you like.</b>

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.840
<b>An angel?</b>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.770
<b>Hey, Apachai!</b>

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.910
<b>What are you doing there?</b>

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.410
<b>Man, you just slack off so easily.</b>

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.410
<b>If you want to eat, do it without upsetting us.</b>

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.900
<b><i>Apachai,</i></b>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.980
<b><i>I heard the name clearly.</i></b>

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.420
<b><i>That’s the enemy's mercenary?</i></b>

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:27.680
<b>Are you sure that you've transferred all the kids and loot from the village onto the main ship?</b>

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:28.350
<b>Yes sir!</b>

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.290
<b>Hey, is Apachai here already?</b>

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.190
<b>Yes he is, Gusco-sama.</b>

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.470
<b>We have assigned him to sweep the decks.</b>

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.620
<b>You fool!</b>

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:39.600
<b>I've told you several times to train him for battle!</b>

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.710
<b><i>Damn.</i></b>

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.420
<b><i>I feel really uneasy right now.</i></b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.330
<b><i>As if a Death God just winked at me.</i></b>

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.870
<b><i>It gives me the shivers.</i></b>

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:51.110
<b>His ship is anchored at a sufficient distance from the port,</b>

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:54.370
<b>and is armed to repel any kind of land assault.</b>

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.680
<b>I see.</b>

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.500
<b>So that is the enemy's leader.</b>

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.080
<b>His face says it all.</b>

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.630
<b>I can clearly see it!</b>

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:04.560
<b>The village children are most probably on that particular ship.</b>

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:07.960
<b>It would not be wise to simply attack them head on.</b>

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.700
<b>We'll have to fly under the radar for as long as we can.</b>

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.140
<b>Yes, Grandpa.</b>

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:18.820
<b>However, I'm quite concerned about their mercenary, Apachai, that Muay Thai practitioner.</b>

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:21.510
<b>Oh well.</b>

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.880
<b>I'll be back in thirty minutes.</b>

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.790
<b>Take care.</b>

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.680
<b>Apachai-san, huh?</b>

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.130
<b>Tastes sweet.</b>

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:37.460
<b>I think I want to see him again!</b>

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:40.680
<b>I can't help but feel that he isn't a bad person.</b>

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.040
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.140
<b>Something blipped on the radar?</b>

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:51.300
<b>Yeah, but its movement is like nothing we've ever seen before.</b>

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.870
<b>Is that a... person?!</b>

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.130
<b>Don't let him get closer!</b>

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.130
<b>Shoot SHOOT!</b>

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.000
<b>He made it on board!</b>

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.510
<b>He infiltrated this place!</b>

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:19.670
<b>Is Apachai still not ready yet?</b>

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.910
<b>He's the only one, that can stop him!</b>

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:24.840
<b>Hurry!</b>

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.040
<b><i>Hito Shuriken!</i></b>

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.040
<b>TL: Human Throwing Star</b>

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.020
<b>You are here!</b>

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.340
<b>Apachai, what are you doing?</b>

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.510
<b>Fight him already!</b>

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.730
<b>Oh, a master level fighter as I thought.</b>

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:41.970
<b>Apachai Hopachai.</b>

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.840
<b>Do it, Apachai.</b>

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.370
<b>The only one that can defeat a Demon is a Death God.</b>

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:01.770
<b>Don't shoot.</b>

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.020
<b>What happened to the intruder?!</b>

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.440
<b>He's fighting Apachai right now.</b>

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:08.620
<b>Near the storage area.</b>

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:24.370
<b>The treasures that I collected!!</b>

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.660
<b>Hey, the entire boat is shaking.</b>

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:35.230
<b>This is bad, if this continues the boat will sink!</b>

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.240
<b>The storage area's badly damaged.</b>

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.860
<b>When will our reinforcements arrive?</b>

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.980
<b>They're currently on their way.</b>

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:45.330
<b>However, the ship's distance from the shore has become a disadvantage now!</b>

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.870
<b>Bring it in then!</b>

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.240
<b>Get the ship closer to shore!</b>

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.770
<b>What's happening?</b>

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.210
<b>Are the village folks trying to retrieve their children?</b>

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.110
<b>Just how many have infiltrated the ship?</b>

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.300
<b>Well that's...</b>

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.800
<b>Time to jam this thing.</b>

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.800
<b>What, just a single person?!</b>

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.060
<b>And moreover it's an old man?</b>

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.920
<b><i>With Grandpa drawing most of the enemy's attention, </i></b>

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:08.160
<b><i>I'm going to sneak in and save the children.</i></b>

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:13.420
<b><i>But, seems like Grandpa's taking an unusual amount of time to finish a matter as simple as this.</i></b>

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:16.040
<b><i>Could it be because he is facing off Apachai-san?</i></b>

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.470
<b>What in the world is happening?</b>

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.600
<b>Demon!</b>

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.760
<b>The Demon is on a rampage!</b>

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.640
<b>Hurry!</b>

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:26.490
<b>The Demon and the God of Death are fighting each other!</b>

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:29.530
<b><i>Now's my chance.</i></b>

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.750
<b><i>But, I wonder where the village children are being kept?</i></b>

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.250
<b><i>I might have to search every corner of the ship.</i></b>

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.220
<b><i>Oh no!</i></b>

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:46.230
<b>One child has escaped!</b>

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:47.480
<b>Capture her!</b>

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.880
<b>Where are the captured children from the village?</b>

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.570
<b>Why would I tell you, big forehead girl!</b>

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.040
<b>Out with it already!</b>

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:00.760
<b>Please don't.</b>

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:01.590
<b>Don't do that!</b>

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.470
<b>That's enough kid!</b>

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.610
<b>Oh a girl!</b>

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.780
<b>Well, still an outrageous kid I'd say.</b>

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.080
<b>You won't be able to fight back.</b>

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.210
<b><i>This is bad.</i></b>

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.210
<b>TL: Knee to the Face</b>

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.210
<b><i>Kao Loi!</i></b>

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.970
<b>Take this young one!</b>

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:24.990
<b>Oh yeah! You're quite good.</b>

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.890
<b>This is great.</b>

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.390
<b>Take this boy.</b>

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:33.800
<b>Four, Three, Two, One!</b>

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:34.290
<b>Four, Three, Two, One!</b>

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:34.860
<b>Four, Three, Two, One!</b>

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:35.730
<b>Four, Three, Two, One!</b>

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:39.110
<b>My blood as a martial artist is boiling up again after a long time thanks to you!</b>

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.330
<b>TL: Infitnite throbbing pain</b>

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.330
<b><i>Muei Mugen Zuki!</i></b>

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.570
<b>Everyone, fire your weapons at the old man!</b>

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.530
<b>But we might hit Apachai too!</b>

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.980
<b>I don't care.</b>

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.180
<b>Then kill both of them!</b>

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:57.070
<b>I won't allow them to destroy my assets any further.</b>

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.730
<b>They're still fighting while evading the bullets!</b>

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.860
<b>Apa... Are you okay there?</b>

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:11.210
<b><i>Oh, he's still worried about his comrades in this situation?</i></b>

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:15.830
<b><i>All you bunch are nothing but a hindrance to our fight!</i></b>

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.200
<b>What the... a shockwave?!</b>

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:25.090
<b>Now there's no one to intrude on us.</b>

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.620
<b>But I don't understand.</b>

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:31.100
<b>Why are you willing to be a mercenary to these kinds of people?</b>

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.480
<b>That's enough.</b>

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.260
<b>You really went all out, didn't ya?</b>

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Grandpa!</b>

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.680
<b>I made a mistake.</b>

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.240
<b>She's your granddaughter, right?</b>

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.900
<b>Want me to blow off her head?</b>

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.880
<b>It’s the <i>onigiri</i>  girl!</b>

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.560
<b>Try it if you dare,</b>

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.000
<b>but it will be the last thing you will do.</b>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.370
<b>That is wrong, Gusco-san.</b>

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.900
<b>She's a good girl!</b>

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.670
<b>Hey Apachai.</b>

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:57.030
<b>Just finish off that old man already.</b>

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.290
<b>He won't be able to move even if he talks big.</b>

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:02.710
<b>I instantly understood after fighting with you,</b>

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.580
<b>that you are not a bad person.</b>

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:06.530
<b>Why are you taking orders from that man?</b>

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.150
<b>I am indebted to him.</b>

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.200
<b>That's right.</b>

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.720
<b>I was the one who gave him something to eat,</b>

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:18.030
<b>when he was starving to death at a port in Thailand.</b>

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.650
<b>That's it?</b>

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.490
<b>Anyway Gusco-san,</b>

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.170
<b>what are you planning to do with those children?</b>

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:27.000
<b>W-Well that's...</b>

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:32.950
<b>I plan to take these poor hungry kids to their rightful heaven.</b>

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:34.400
<b>You're lying.</b>

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.180
<b>I know.</b>

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.310
<b>Those eyes show fear.</b>

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.360
<b>Apachai-san, these are bad people!</b>

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.630
<b>They perform terrible acts, like kidnapping.</b>

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.130
<b>Shut up you brat!</b>

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.010
<b>I don't care, just shoot.</b>

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.990
<b>And don't even try to dodge you two.</b>

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:57.380
<b>Don't worry, I won't.</b>

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.770
<b>Since when did you...?</b>

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.390
<b>You can't just take your eyes off the enemy, you know.</b>

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:05.110
<b>Especially when you're taking my granddaughter as a hostage.</b>

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:07.140
<b>Hey, somebody save– eh...</b>

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:12.410
<b>It's okay, I'm going to return you all to your homes.</b>

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:13.510
<b>He's strong!</b>

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.030
<b>So he's that strong?</b>

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.980
<b>Now, let's have you disappear for good, okay?</b>

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:20.910
<b>You're tainted down to the bone.</b>

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:25.040
<b>You'll never become a better person again, no matter how much you try to atone for you sins.</b>

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.280
<b>You can't do that!</b>

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.170
<b>He can't continue living anymore if you do!</b>

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.480
<b>I don't know,</b>

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.470
<b>but you sure are a kind soul.</b>

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:34.900
<b>You can't dodge at this distance!</b>

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.190
<b>TL: Retention Impact</b>

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.190
<b><i>Boushin Hashougeki!</i></b>

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.020
<b>Gusco-san is dead!</b>

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.260
<b>The ship is sinking!</b>

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:48.740
<b>Let's get out of here!</b>

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:49.620
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.580
<b>Get the children into anything that will float!</b>

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.340
<b>And those who are unconscious as well.</b>

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.570
<b>Hurry up!</b>

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:06.490
<b>Where am I?</b>

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:11.520
<b>Gusco-sama, we retrieved the box you were in.</b>

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.480
<b>W-We really thought you were dead.</b>

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.520
<b>Gusco? Who is that?</b>

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.420
<b>Who in the world am I?</b>

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:25.120
<b>You hit him using a <i>Boushin Hashougeki?</i></b>

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:29.770
<b>A technique that erases memories? You liar.</b>

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.800
<b>But it's true... right?</b>

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:35.560
<b>Even if it <i>is</i>  true, why did you erase his memory?</b>

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.350
<b>You could have handed him over to the cops.</b>

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.450
<b>The police force of that country was pretty unreliable you know.</b>

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:41.770
<b>Even if he was put behind bars,</b>

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.160
<b>he would have escaped easily.</b>

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.080
<b>He was simply someone incapable of being anything but a villain.</b>

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:50.260
<b>Executing him wasn't really a just solution either.</b>

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:54.380
<b>Which is why I erased his life that was stained with evil.</b>

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.840
<b>Killing his sinful memories, giving him a complete new start.</b>

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.560
<b>Well I guess you're right.</b>

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:02.300
<b>So were all the kids okay?</b>

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:07.960
<b>Oh yeah. We took them all back to the village the next morning.</b>

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:14.560
<b>Apachai even brought back three boxes of treasure.</b>

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.870
<b>Get soldiers of your own using these riches,</b>

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.020
<b>so that your village will never be attacked or harassed again.</b>

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.620
<b>Yes, I thank you from the bottom of my heart.</b>

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.060
<b>Then I'll receive my reward now.</b>

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.780
<b>It's all in my hands now.</b>

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.550
<b>That's not fair.</b>

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:34.660
<b>How about taking whatever you want from these treasures instead of taking that?</b>

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:40.650
<b>No, this money, which is infused with the thoughts of the entire village,</b>

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.990
<b>holds ten times the amount of those treasures.</b>

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:51.040
<b>Grandpa, that man is still following us.</b>

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.540
<b>Just keep your eyes on the road.</b>

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.900
<b>He'll probably give up halfway.</b>

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:07.600
<b>S-So he followed you all the way here to Ryōzanpaku?</b>

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:12.100
<b>I really had a hard time when he was inspected by the authorities.</b>

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.200
<b>He was just too pushy.</b>

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.220
<b>Yeah, I was!</b>

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.220
<b><i>Is this all really true?</i></b>

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.410
<b><i>Maybe it really is.</i></b>

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:22.620
<b><i>Even if they planned on fabricating a lie, they would have at least said something more believable.</i></b>

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:24.910
<b>Oh wait! What about the Chōjū-giga?!</b>

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.930
<b>Your story was so epic that I almost forgot.</b>

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:30.490
<b>So why do you like those scrolls then?</b>

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:33.620
<b>You never explained their relationship to this story at all!</b>

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:42.510
<b>I promised to keep this a secret from Miu-san if there was a good reason behind it, but...</b>

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.640
<b>Unfortunately I wasn't able to find one, so I'm telling her all about this.</b>

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.290
<b>Now then.</b>

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.010
<b>Actually,</b>

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:53.420
<b>when my fight with Apachai reached its peak,</b>

